  "starterCode": "# Gated Attention — reconstructed educational contract\nimport numpy as np\n\ndef solution(attention_output, gate_logits):\n    # TODO: implement the operation described in the problem statement\n    pass\n",
  "solution": "### 💡 Intuition & Approach\nThe implementation computes **Gated Attention** by following direct architectural principles, leveraging vectorized operations to ensure both correctness and optimal runtime efficiency.\n\n### ⚡ Python Reference Implementation\n```python\nimport numpy as np\ndef solution(attention_output, gate_logits):\n    a=np.asarray(attention_output,dtype=float); g=1/(1+np.exp(-np.asarray(gate_logits,dtype=float)))\n    return (a*g).tolist()\n```\n\n### ⏱️ Complexity Analysis\n- **Time Complexity**: $\\mathcal{O}(N)$ where $N$ represents the primary sequence length or dimension.\n- **Space Complexity**: $\\mathcal{O}(N)$ auxiliary memory for computing and storing output representations.",
